<title>FRANCE: Fr Telecom says delay makes no difference.</title>
<headline>Fr Telecom says delay makes no difference.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom SA said a government decision to delay the sale of shares in the company by four weeks due to an early parliamentary election would make no difference to its market flotation.</p>
<p>&quot;We take note of this decision, which is a technical delay of a month,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;France Telecom and the government had decided to make the share sale a popular and very big operation for which an important communication campaign is needed. This is hardly compatible with an election campaign,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
